$ over a change in $D.$ So, it represents a ratio of the units:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}E}{\\text{d}D}: & \\frac{\\text{euros}}{\\text{dollars}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn other words, $\\frac{\\text{d}E}{\\text{d}D}$ is measured in \"euros per dollar\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-72092/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0fa5bdf9-4b27-5565-9ee1-ecb9f9db4791"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72092"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110038/selection/69a9744f5eac7a1719d0ec0685bb9b867b732ff4e0bb559737e3aa58fa94fda6" :answer/id #uuid "812be774-ef9e-5fe2-97e3-7f604a3e2bc8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "cubic dollars per squared liters" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110038/selection/cfd9f2ef69f9c9b65d1072fc7fde2b1f1dce655e55eda6872bac904231df08c0" :answer/id #uuid "5c6f9cfb-609f-5074-b1ea-65686cb3a251" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "dollars per milliliter" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110038/selection/8d9d0fab7c247dc6595a15b803f5fa61c9ba06a9af6034c50b88612f8fbd17b3" :answer/id #uuid "bf32f833-c1b4-5006-a3d5-13e84d6fd7c5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "milliliters per squared dollar" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110038/selection/1be4c0f2361d2f7807eff4ea683ca0883261fdb5835a180bcd6e985e1fafd693" :answer/id #uuid "35384093-49f8-5095-975c-6ce2ddcfde41" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "dollars per liter" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110038/selection/8fbd5ff152a1e7c869a9a52182c14b92d4614700b8ff6f3f484d49a7ef92acc6" :answer/id #uuid "c34554b7-41e9-581b-9c78-0302f52d9ec9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "liters per dollar" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110038/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "883daeec-8f2f-55d5-802d-de091780489d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q